      },
      "description": "<p>While you bear the <strong>Symbol of Truth</strong>, checks performed to examine or locate you, as well as Accuracy Checks and Magic Checks for attacks and offensive spells that include you among their targets, gain a +2 bonus. If an attack or spell targets multiple creatures bearing this <strong>symbol</strong>, the effect will be <strong>cumulative</strong>.</p>",
